The '''War on Corellia''' was a civil war that took place in the wake of the [[Nihil]] [[Infiltration on Corellia|infiltration]] of the [[planet]] [[Corellia]].<ref name="Timelines" /> Following the [[destruction of Starlight Beacon]], the Nihil took root on the planet, and a contingent of [[Corellian]]s believed the only way to prevent the planet from sharing the same fate as [[Starlight Beacon]] was to embrace the Nihil's rule. They were opposed by Corellians such as [[Alys Ongwa|Alys "Crash" Ongwa]] and [[Svi'no Atchapat]]. Two [[Jedi]]&mdash;[[Jedi Master]] [[Conithr]] and her [[Padawan]], [[Ruu]]&mdash;chose to not to return to [[Coruscant]] after the [[Jedi Order]] recalled the Jedi there, instead choosing to remain on Corellia to defend the Corellians from the Nihil. During one incident, Conithr was [[Death|killed]], causing Ruu to fall to the [[dark side of the Force]] and stop operating as a Jedi.<ref name="Rogue Element" />

A [[Massacre at the Greens|massacre of Nihil forces]] occurred at [[the Greens]]<ref name="Crash and Burn" /> and marked the effective end to any major Nihil operation on Corellia.<ref name="Adventures 7">[[The High Republic Adventures (2023) 7|''The High Republic Adventures'' (2023) 7]]</ref>

